[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0370","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0370.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0360","title":"ISC INN 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"INN（InterNetNews）新闻服务器 2.2.1 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的新闻组文章（article）触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 INN 2.2.1 及之前版本的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，危害等级中等。建议升级至 INN 2.2.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0360"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33Z","remediation":"升级 INN 至 2.2.2 或更高版本。Caldera OpenLinux 用户安装 CSSA-1999-038 补丁包，SuSE Linux 用户应用 suse_security_announce_34 更新。临时缓解措施：在防火墙限制对 NNTP 端口（119/tcp）的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_34.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1249","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0360.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0360","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0360.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0360.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-w2p4-fvrc-29cj/GHSA-w2p4-fvrc-29cj.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/inn_buff_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/scipag/AttackToolKit/blob/78bf88564956b8f18a37659dc3d345093e95a136/plugins/ISC%20INN%20prior%202.2.2%20news%20articles%20buffer%20overflows.plugin","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0360.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0370.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0029","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0031","title":"Red Hat Linux initscripts 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 的 initscripts 初始化脚本包中存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接文件，诱使 initscripts 在处理临时文件时以 root 权限执行任意文件操作，从而将自身权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 多个版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0031"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 initscripts 软件包至 5.00-1 或更高版本（Red Hat Linux 6.x 对应 RHSA-2000:001 安全公告）。脚本中应使用 mktemp 创建临时文件而非固定路径，避免 /tmp 目录下的符号链接劫持。如无法升级，移除 initscripts 中写入 /tmp 的可疑临时文件操作作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0031","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0031.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0031.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0031","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/70a2e67cf4b780574379fe6685466348a1f2340b/2000/CVE-2000-0031.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0031.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0031.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88243/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0031.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0002","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0760","title":"Apache Tomcat Snoop Servlet 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 3.0 和 3.1 版本中的 Snoop Servlet 存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标服务器发送一个带有 .snp 扩展名的不存在 URL 的请求，即可触发 Snoop Servlet 输出包含系统环境变量、JVM 参数、请求头等敏感信息的调试数据。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本 Tomcat 的所有 Web 应用服务器，攻击条件极为简单——仅需目标服务器开放 HTTP 端口且部署了存在漏洞的 Tomcat 版本。成功利用后，攻击者可获取系统配置信息，为后续进一步渗透攻击提供有力参考。Apache 官方已在后续版本中移除了 Snoop Servlet 或对其访问权限进行了限制以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0760"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"强烈建议立即将 Tomcat 升级至 Apache 官方支持的 9.0.x 或更高版本以获得完整安全修复。若短期内无法升级，须采取以下缓解措施：第一，直接从 webapps 目录中删除整个 examples 示例应用目录；第二，若需保留 examples 应用，编辑 webapps/examples/WEB-INF/web.xml，移除 SnoopServlet 的 &lt;servlet&gt; 和 &lt;servlet-mapping&gt; 配置条目后重启 Tomcat；第三，通过 Apache HTTP Server 的 mod_jk 或 front Controller 配置，禁止外部客户端对 /examples/ 路径的访问；第四，服务器上需关闭 8007 端口的 AJP12 协议监听（该协议在 Tomcat 3.x 中默认开启且同样存在严重安全问题）。请注意，Tomcat 3.x 已于多年前停止维护，Apache 官方表示不再为该版本发布安全更新，升级至受支持的稳定版本是最彻底的解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1532","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26date%3D2000-07-15%26msg%3DPine.SUN.3.96.1000719235404.24004A-100000%40grex.cyberspace.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20132","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0760.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2000/CVE-2000-0760.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0760.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c97d5ffdc5a2cf56b1acb2dd5f27977ef5ef9b47/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0760.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/apache/tomcat/CVE-2000-0760.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/966d6acc4d3db576e6440ff8f64cc85a59a26a1a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0760.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2000/CVE-2000-0760.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0760","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0760.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0760.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2000-0760.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0002.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0002.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0916","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0916.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0768","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 客户端文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 客户端文件读取漏洞（CVE-2000-0768）是早期 IE 浏览器中存在的客户端文件读取漏洞。漏洞原理在于 IE 对特定协议处理器（如 file://、res:// 等）的安全限制不足，攻击者可构造恶意 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，利用 IE 对本地文件协议处理不当，绕过同源策略读取本地文件系统中的敏感文件内容。影响范围覆盖 Internet Explorer 5.x 及早期 6.0 版本，运行于 Windows 95/98/NT/2000 等系统之上。攻击条件为受害者使用受影响版本 IE 访问攻击者构造的恶意网页，无需用户交互即可触发。利用方式为构造包含 file:// 或 res:// 协议引用本地敏感文件（如系统配置文件、注册表导出文件）的恶意页面，诱导受害者访问后通过脚本读取文件内容并外传。Microsoft 已于 2000 年发布安全公告 MS00-060 发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至 IE 5.01 SP2/5.5 SP2/6.0 以上版本并应用补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0768"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-10-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级到最新版本的Microsoft Edge（基于Chromium）或Firefox浏览器彻底替代已废弃的Internet Explorer。如需继续使用IE，请安装2001年发布的IE7安全补丁包，并同时部署2004年发布的IE8初始版，使用支持ActiveX的安全版本。此外，建议禁用IE的ActiveX控制和高危功能，并在防火墙中封锁IE的IE4/IE5激活服务。无法立即升级的情况下，可通过注册表禁用IE的ActiveX控制，并使用 Win + R 运行\"about:blank\"强制浏览器加载空白页面以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0768","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d88eae8568d326953e6a84a5e0ac0ad4cbb40816/2000/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0768.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0768.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0768.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0916.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0887","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0887.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0738","title":"McAfee WebShield SMTP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Network Associates WebShield SMTP 4.5 版本在处理邮件地址时存在输入验证缺陷。远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 服务发送特制的邮件地址请求，触发程序异常导致服务崩溃或资源耗尽，从而实现拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞影响 WebShield SMTP 4.5 及相关版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络环境下触发，直接导致邮件过滤服务不可用，影响系统稳定性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0738"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-10-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Network Associates WebShield 升级至 4.6 或更高版本，或迁移至更现代的邮件过滤网关。若无法立即升级，应在防火墙层面限制 SMTP 端口（TCP 25）的访问来源，仅允许受信任的 IP 地址连接以缓解潜在的拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/96f11c5f4af445468fc4b15b88a4ff3f98a02c73/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0738.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b18a069a6f64168900db1bdcf67a526ee6f9b5af/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0738.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0738","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0738.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0738.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/315d6d428c9813126fac0eadf43ea4f31aa35f4e/2000/CVE-2000-0738.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/04ded07645d3d1d1ff4bc7fdbd85d7a922796dcd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0738.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a8ab7e50610a40270e5e9a2820bdbd3f2f8bafbc/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0738.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0738.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0738.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0887.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0594","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0594.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0795","title":"SGI IRIX lpstat 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IRIX 操作系统中的打印状态查询工具 lpstat (/usr/bin/lpstat) 在命令行参数处理时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。漏洞原理是该程序在解析用户输入的命令行参数时，未对“-n”选项所跟随的字符串长度进行有效校验，导致可被攻击者通过输入超长数据覆盖栈帧返回地址，从而劫控程序执行流程。攻击条件要求攻击者已获得目标 IRIX 系统的普通用户访问权限（本地可访问），无需额外网络交互。一旦触发，该漏洞允许本地普通用户通过精心构造的溢出载荷执行任意指令，从而获得 root 权限，实现本地权限提升，最终完整控制受影响主机。受影响范围包括 IRIX 5.3、6.2、6.3、6.4、6.5 及 6.5.11 等多个版本系统。目前 Last Stage of Delirium 已发布针对该漏洞的本地利用代码，证实攻击者可借助栈溢出机制在存在漏洞的 IRIX 系统上执行任意代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0795"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-10-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 SGI 官方发布的 IRIX 安全补丁：IRIX 6.5 系统应用 Patch 3878（或更新的同类补丁），IRIX 6.4 应用 Patch 3879，IRIX 6.3 应用 Patch 3880，IRIX 6.2 应用 Patch 3881。通过执行 `versions -bR | grep 3878` 验证补丁是否已安装。若无法立即打补丁，可通过移除 lpstat 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施：执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpstat` 及 `chmod u-s /bin/lpstat` 取消 root 权限执行，同时限制普通用户对打印子系统的访问权限。由于 IRIX 已停止维护，强烈建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20129","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e3ffc8aa96e889e4591b3a2ccc4e1f7e6b2ab4fc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0795","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/050f0b0b35f5586b897c9fa1e5cb22907b6f29e8/2000/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0795.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0795.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0594.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0943","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0943.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1214","title":"Red Hat iputils ping 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"iputils 工具包中的 ping 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，其 outpack 或 buf 变量在处理 ICMP 数据包时未正确检查边界，导致本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 ICMP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得提升的权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 至 7J 及其他发行版中 iputils 20001010 之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需认证即可利用，成功利用后可获取目标系统的部分机密性、完整性和可用性控制权。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1214"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23Z","remediation":"升级 iputils 至 20001010 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户可通过 RHN 更新或手动安装更新后的 iputils RPM 包。如无法升级，可移除 ping 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /bin/ping）以消除本地提权路径，但会限制普通用户使用 ping 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0429.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97208562830613&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97249980727834&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5431.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-087.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1813","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1214","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2000/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1214.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/c40ca36b53575027805a3cdaf11cc45d5afcf3f6/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20250605.bb","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1214.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0943.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0942","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0942.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1213","title":"Red Hat Linux iputils 未正确释放特权漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 至 7J 及其他操作系统中分发的 iputils 工具包（20001010 版本之前）的 ping 命令存在权限管理缺陷。ping 在获取原始套接字（raw socket）后未能正确释放特权级别，导致后续代码执行仍以高权限运行。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过发送特制网络请求触发 ping 中的其他潜在缺陷，从而获取目标系统的机密信息、篡改数据或造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1213"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 iputils 至 20001010 或更高版本（该版本已修复获取 raw socket 后未释放特权的问题）。Red Hat Linux 用户可通过 RHN 或官方渠道获取更新包。如无法升级，可移除 ping 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /bin/ping），仅允许 root 用户执行，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0429.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97249980727834&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-087.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1213","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2000/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/12065efa5942c8c399e6c39fc2649ac2e94409b9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1213.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/6f7a1ed79a396fbd7a4a98234188f1585adeda9f/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20250605.bb","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1213.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0942.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1146","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1146.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1204","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_vhost_alias 虚拟主机模块源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Apache 1.3.9/1.3.11/1.3.12 的 mod_vhost_alias 虚拟主机模块存在信息泄露漏洞。当 cgi-bin 目录位于文档根目录下时，远程攻击者可通过特制请求获取 CGI 程序的源代码，导致敏感信息（如数据库凭据、业务逻辑）泄露。攻击无需认证，仅需网络访问即可触发，影响使用该版本 Apache 且将 cgi-bin 置于 document root 下的虚拟主机配置。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1204"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-10-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:22Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.14 或更高版本（官方于 2000-10-13 发布 1.3.14 修复此问题）。如无法立即升级，确保 cgi-bin 目录不在 DocumentRoot 之下，避免 mod_vhost_alias 将 CGI 路径解析为静态文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/00-10-13","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb9c9f42dafa25d2f669dac2a536a03f2575bc5ec1be6f480618aee10%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1204.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1204","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1204.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1204.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1204.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1204.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2000/CVE-2000-1204.json","https://github.com/apache/httpd-site/blob/6c9d84ea3eb3555eff4f5fd8a942b1d269c35a7f/content/security/json/CVE-2000-1204.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1204.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1204.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0603","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0816","title":"RedHat Tmpwatch 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2/7.0 系统中 tmpwatch 工具的 --fuser 选项存在任意命令执行漏洞。tmpwatch 用于清理临时文件，其 --fuser 选项在处理文件名时未对 shell 元字符（如反引号、$() 等）进行正确过滤或转义。本地攻击者可通过创建包含 shell 元字符的特殊文件名，当系统管理员或定时任务调用 tmpwatch --fuser 扫描目录时，这些文件名中的恶意命令会被 shell 解析执行，从而导致攻击者以运行 tmpwatch 进程的权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 和 7.0 版本，攻击者需要拥有本地文件创建权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0816"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32Z","remediation":"升级 tmpwatch 至修复版本（Red Hat 已通过 RHSA-2000-060 发布补丁），该补丁修复了 --fuser 选项将文件名直接传入 system() 调用导致的 shell 元字符注入问题。对于 Red Hat 6.2/7.0 等已停止维护的版本，建议升级至受支持的 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 版本（如 RHEL 7/8/9），或禁用 tmpwatch 的 --fuser 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-056.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-080.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1785","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise64.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5320","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20285","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0816","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2000/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0816.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2000-0816.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0603.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0603.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0936","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0936.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1207","title":"Red Hat Linux userhelper 格式字符串漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 的 usermode 软件包中 userhelper 程序存在权限提升漏洞，该程序以 root 权限执行非 setuid 程序而未激活 glibc 的安全检查机制。攻击者可通过设置 LANG 或 LC_ALL 环境变量，利用 glibc 格式化字符串漏洞（CVE-2000-0844）以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 系统，攻击条件为攻击者能够控制环境变量，利用方式为构造包含格式化字符串 specifier 的恶意环境变量触发漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1207"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-09-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:22Z","remediation":"立即安装 Red Hat 安全更新 RHSA-2000-075，升级 usermode 包至修复版本（rpm -Uvh usermode-*.rpm）。若无法立即更新，可临时将 LANG 和 LC_ALL 环境变量置空或设为 C，以阻止通过格式字符串漏洞利用 userhelper 的攻击路径。更新后验证 userhelper 不再以 root 权限执行非 setuid 程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97034397026473&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97063854808796&w=2","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-059.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-075.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1207.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/38590de6b24a9e23ae9a8ab63556f3ebbcbcf955/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1207.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1207.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/908f27ce56b05b89bd69be9a1ba710270fd64008/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2000/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1207","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2000/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1207.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0936.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0363","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0354","title":"Linux Mirror 目录遍历文件创建漏洞","description":"Linux 系统下的 mirror 2.8.x 版本存在路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的文件名或目录名，利用 mirror 工具在处理镜像下载时未对目标路径进行充分校验的缺陷，将文件写入到本地目标目录的上一级目录中，实现目录跳转。该漏洞可导致攻击者在目标系统上任意位置创建文件，进而可能结合其他漏洞实现权限提升或执行恶意代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0354"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-09-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32Z","remediation":"升级 mirror 至 2.9 或更高版本（2.9 已修复目录遍历问题）。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get install mirror 更新；如不再需要 mirror 功能，建议迁移至 wget 或 rsync 替代。若无法升级，可在 mirror 配置中限制目标目录权限，确保运行 mirror 的用户无上级目录写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/1999/19991018","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_22.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/681","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=15769.990928%40tomcat.ru","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0354.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0354","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0354.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0354.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-353f-x9x4-qj59/GHSA-353f-x9x4-qj59.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0354.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a91f0728-670a-4dba-83d8-8ecbd61b2f53.json","https://github.com/l/debian-webwml/blob/80cd9461d384c50e61f7c585e566ce9d00c113fc/webwml/english/security/1999/19991018.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-2000","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-2000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1079","title":"Microsoft Windows 9x/NT 4.0/2000 NetBIOS 缓冲腐败漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/NT/2000 系统中 CIFS 浏览器协议与 NetBIOS 的实现存在缓冲腐败漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的欺骗性 Browse Frame 请求（以单播或 UDP 广播数据报形式），修改动态 NetBIOS 名称缓存条目，导致系统将网络流量错误地重定向到攻击者控制的恶意主机。该漏洞影响 Windows 95、98、NT 4.0 及 2000 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致信息泄露、服务中断或权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1079"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-08-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-067 提供的补丁程序。临时缓解措施：在防火墙阻止 UDP 137-138 端口和 TCP 139-445 端口入站流量，或禁用 NetBIOS over TCP/IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0116.html","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/045.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1620","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5168","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1079","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1079.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1079.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1079.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1079","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1079.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1079.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1079.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1079.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1079.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2000/CVE-2000-1079.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-2000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0444","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0444.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0545","title":"BSD mailx 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 系统上 BSD mailx 8.1.1-10 版本中的 mail 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 -c（抄送）参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致程序崩溃或执行任意代码，从而获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响运行 BSD mailx 8.1.1-10 的 Linux 发行版，攻击者需拥有本地用户权限即可利用，无需交互操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0545"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-08-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58Z","remediation":"升级 mailx 至修补后的版本（如 Debian 于 2000-06-05 发布的安全更新），或替换为不受影响的现代版本（如 Heirloom mailx 或 s-nail）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对 mailx 的 SUID 执行权限，移除不必要的 SUID 位。该漏洞通过超长 -c 参数触发缓冲区溢出，仅本地用户可利用，建议优先通过包管理器更新系统邮件客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0435.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000605","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1305","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0545.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0545","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-054